# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never committed: dependencies, build output, downloaded weights, caches.
#
# GitHub rejects a push containing any file over 100 MB, and warns above 50 MB.
# A push of this project was rejected for three such files, none of them source:
#
#     .model-cache/model.safetensors                1434 MB   downloaded weights
#     node_modules/@next/swc-win32-x64-msvc/…node    105 MB   npm install
#     .next/dev/cache/turbopack/…/00000595.sst        86 MB   build cache
#
# Every one of them is regenerated by the commands in README.md, so they belong
# nowhere near version control. Patterns are duplicated with and without a
# leading directory so they match whether this folder is the repository root or
# a subdirectory of it. See docs/GITHUB.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.yarn/

# Next.js build output, dev cache and generated types
.next/
out/
out-v0/
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Downloaded model weights and converted checkpoints (tools/build_artifacts.py
# re-downloads Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B into .model-cache/ on first run)
.model-cache/
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# Python scratch
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.freebuff/
